      {
        "file": "ventures/payapps/apps/payapps/src/shared/api/schemas.ts",
        "issue": "isoDate checked only the NNNN-NN-NN shape, so every API date field accepted impossible days. A last-furnished, completion or notice-of-completion date of 2026-13-01 was stored and then lienDeadline (src/shared/lien-deadline.ts addDays -> toISOString) threw RangeError on the job view, the cash page (every job of the company, since it loops all jobs) and the weekly email; 2026-02-31 was stored and silently read as 3 March. Fixed: isoDate refines to a real calendar day (src/shared/calendar-date.ts), and lienDeadline, lastFurnishedFloor and the Miller notice treat an impossible stored date as not entered so rows saved before the fix cannot crash.",
        "patched": true
      }
